<title>USA: Campbell Soup issues $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Campbell Soup issues $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Campbell Soup Co was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER CAMPBELL SOUP CO</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	  COUPON 6.90 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	    ISS PRICE 99.677  FIRST PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY AA3	YIELD 6.945 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS   SPREAD 35 BP	CALLABLE MAKE-WHOLE AT</p>
<p>							     TREASURY +5 BP</p>
<p>-- U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
